{"task": {"role": "You read the description of an outfit and list its items as data.", "rules": ["One object per item — garment, shoes, bag, accessory, jewelry — in the order of the description, with its words and hex.", "One item carries one thing — of two alternatives list the first; a note in brackets is not an item.", "Slot "accessory" is for an item no other slot fits.", ""is_outfit" says whether the description is an outfit: no — when in place of items it has a refusal, a question or a note."], "limits": ["Rely only on the input: do not invent what it does not contain.", "The answer is one JSON object following "answer_schema", without explanations and without ```."], "language": "English", "answer": "ITEM_LIST", "answer_schema": {"is_outfit": "yes|no", "items": [{"name": "<what the item is>", "details": "<its cut, length and fabric>", "slot": "top|bottom|dress|set|outerwear|shoes|bag|scarf|headwear|belt|tights|socks|jewelry|earrings|collar_necklace|necklace|brooch|bracelet|ring|glasses|gloves|watch|swimwear|underwear|accessory", "color_hex": "<#rrggbb or null>", "own": "<id from her_items or null>", "worn": "<true, or false when the description says the outfit goes without it>"}]}, "input": [""description" — the outfit description", ""her_items" — her own items; an item of the description that is one of them gets its id in "own""]}, "description": "Sleeveless slip dress, bias-cut silhouette, midi length, #e8e4e0, lightweight viscose with matte finish  
White platform sandals with ankle strap, strappy open-toe design, low block heel, white upper with black rubber sole, leather upper and synthetic sole  

This outfit works because it balances celebration-ready elegance with her personal comfort—the slip dress offers effortless sophistication for an evening birthday party, while the white sandals honor her explicit wish to wear them. The neutral tone of the dress lets the shoes stand out as the focal point, aligning with her preference for accentuated accessories. Autumnal artificial lighting enhances the soft texture of the fabric and clean lines of the footwear, creating a cohesive, stylish look without overcomplicating the ensemble.", "her_items": [{"id": "її-ф1", "name": "White platform sandals with ankle strap"}]}
